Package: fauxseq
Type: Package
Title: A Synthetic Timeseries RNA-seq Data Generator
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bharath", "Ananthasubramaniam", , "bharath.ananthasubramaniam@hu-berlin.de", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
  )
Description: This package generates synthetic time-series RNA-seq data containing a user-specified fraction of rhythmic genes, while preserving the empirical relationship between mean gene expression and variability observed across biological replicates. It is the R counterpart to pyfauxseq, a Python package providing the same functionality.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
